
Automated tests have not been added yet.

Recommended Wokwi acceptance checks:

1. Start the simulator after a successful PlatformIO build.
2. Confirm the OLED shows `SYSTEM READY`.
3. Scan a registered card and verify the green LED and attendance message.
4. Scan the same card again and verify the duplicate warning and red LED.
5. Scan an unregistered card and verify the access-denied message.
6. Disable Wi-Fi and verify the device enters offline mode and records the
	attendance locally for the current session.

The sample student UIDs are documented in `src/main.cpp`. Add PlatformIO
unit tests here when attendance matching and cloud response handling are
extracted into testable functions.
